# Awesome AI Prompt Tools

> A curated list of tools for writing, managing, and testing AI prompts and agents.

---

## Prompt Generators & Libraries

| Tool | Description |
|------|-------------|
| [GPT Prompt Maker](https://gptpromptmaker.com) | Structured prompt library with 500+ templates for ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini. Uses frameworks like CO-STAR, RISEN, and CRAFT. |

---

## AI Agent Testing & Red-Teaming

| Tool | Description |
|------|-------------|
| [BotGauge](https://botgauge.com) | AI agent red-teaming and evaluation platform. Runs adversarial scenarios, detects policy violations, and builds continuous eval suites. |

---

## Contributing

PRs welcome. Add tools that are actively maintained and genuinely useful.

1. Fork this repo
2. Add your tool under the relevant section
3. Open a pull request
